title: Root Scene
new-page: true
go-to: post_event if started = 1; start_menu if started = 0

@start_menu
new-page: true

= The Last {!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!}

## A constitutional campaign, 1949–1951

Version 0.3.0

Coordinate the opposition, contest the disputed Sixteenth
{!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!}
election, and decide how separate constitutional politicians and the organized
{!<span class="term term-constitutionalist">!}Iran Party{!</span>!} work
together before they share a formal coalition.

- @start_game: Begin the Historical Scenario
- @historical_primer: Historical Primer
- @about: About this release

@historical_primer
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
if (typeof window !== "undefined" && window.location) {
    window.location.assign("timeline.html");
}
!}

